1. Add Product
--------------------------------------------
Method: POST

http://localhost:8080/product/add

Body (JSON)

{
    "name":"Laptop",
    "brand":"Dell",
    "category":"Electronics",
    "price":65000,
    "quantity":5
}
2. Get All Products
------------------------------------------
Method: GET

http://localhost:8080/product/all
3. Get Product By ID
--------------------------------------------
Method: GET

http://localhost:8080/product/1

Replace 1 with the required product ID.

4. Update Product
------------------------------------------
Method: PUT

http://localhost:8080/product/update/1

Body (JSON)

{
    "name":"Laptop",
    "brand":"HP",
    "category":"Electronics",
    "price":70000,
    "quantity":8
}
5. Delete Product
-------------------------------------------
Method: DELETE

http://localhost:8080/product/delete/1

Replace 1 with the product ID you want to delete.

Summary
--------------------------------------------
Method	URL
POST	  http://localhost:8080/product/add
GET	    http://localhost:8080/product/all
GET	    http://localhost:8080/product/{id}
PUT	    http://localhost:8080/product/update/{id}
DELETE  http://localhost:8080/product/delete/{id}

These are all the CRUD API endpoints for your Product Management System.
